right here

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.300
Crew chiefs for Blocks S through Y, verify removal of all workers and report in.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:54.550
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:54.550
<b>Annunciation</b>

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.900
All sections, final stage complete.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.530
Verified. All green.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.700
Gate interior is vacated.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:04.560
Hold countdown at T minus 40 seconds.

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:12.030
True science isn't without a sense of irony.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:12.730
Hm?

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.220
This turned out to be the first "Enterprise" to be sent into space.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.520
We've got a problem!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:26.260
They say that the President of the United States is gonna talk on TV tonight!

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.950
Talk? About what?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.030
Everything.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:34.660
We just got a report from Washington. The bastard's betrayed us.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.620
He's going to reveal everything he knows!

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:45.000
That the U.S. government made contact with aliens in the 1960s...

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:50.190
...and that humanity and Saint have been in a state of war ever since,

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.260
...and he'll even reveal the existence of Management,

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.590
...which has hidden everything from the outside world.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.520
This may prove fatal for him.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.400
Oh, is that all?

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.800
We control every mass media outlet in the world.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.000
It's no trouble at all.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.120
I'll see to it that the press conference is cancelled.

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:10.310
It's me.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.860
I want two skilled snipers and Mr. Oswald standing by within the hour.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.810
We'll run this as a "lone gunman" crime.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.990
No, I want two snipers.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:28.380
Well, well. It's been a while since the last time a U.S. presidency ended in assassination.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.860
Test preparations are complete.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.370
Feel free to start. We're done here.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:38.940
I'll continue, then.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:44.460
About that Vesper special android that Professor Mephlis was investigating...

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:49.790
I've learned something quite interesting from the data he collected.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:54.130
Unbelievable. You scientists are beyond any hope of redemption.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:59.520
Doctor Cyanan, you were after it, too, I assume?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:03.220
Yes. But there really is something fascinating here.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:08.510
We'd always thought that the Vesper organization had split off from Saint.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.920
In other words, that they are a faction of moderates among the aliens.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.050
This, however, doesn't seem to be entirely the case.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:23.110
It's true that we can determine that the majority of V1046R-MAHORO's technology...

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.000
...is extremely advanced and is alien in origin.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:30.180
As for the weaponry installed inside the unit itself, however...

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.790
Those were a bit different.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.930
Surprisingly, screws were used in various locations.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:43.570
These are metric screws, clearly Terran in origin.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.500
Just today, I was able to pinpoint the manufacturer of those screws.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:52.630
A Japanese corporation... Konoe Heavy Industries.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:54.840
I see.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.990
You don't seem surprised.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.900
You were already aware of these facts?

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:08.670
I knew. I've known for decades.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.140
Yuichiro... What will your next move be?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.570
It will be checkmate this time.

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:19.930
Destroy!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.430
Destroy!

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.100
Destroy!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.060
Destroy!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.060
No!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.780
I'm so scared... H-Help me...

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:47.420
Help me...

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:50.530
Slash?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.850
Suguru?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:10.730
Ow...

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:12.470
Ow...

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:14.160
It hurts...

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:15.880
It hurts...

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.590
It hurts...

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:19.440
It hurts...

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.130
It hurts...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.010
It doesn't hurt.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.830
I shouldn't feel pain.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.700
Suguru?

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:37.610
Suguru?

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:42.610
Where in the world could he have gone?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.960
Hey, Mahoro?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.560
What's the matter?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.850
She's got no shoes on...

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:03.970
Suguru?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:06.820
Oh, brother...

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.390
My target this time is a plain ol' junior high school student.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.210
My missions just keep getting more and more boring.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.040
Don't overexert yourself.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.110
Once you have the fear of death etched into you, it never goes away.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:40.190
They used to call you the most powerful warrior there was, didn't they?

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.710
Was that the first time you ever came close to being destroyed?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.310
Tell me. What did it feel like?

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:54.160
My orders are to kill Suguru Misato.

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:56.150
Not to fight you.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:10:01.200
Besides, I've learned a few things about your body.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.550
If I simply wait for his guardian to cease functioning,

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.860
...I'll be able to finish my job easily.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:12.570
Is there really any need for me to take the risk of fighting you?

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.390
This is pretty nice.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:25.500
It's the ultimate weapon that they couldn't remove from your body.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:28.930
They call it "Shining Darkness", right?

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.510
This is a copy.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:34.280
I really like it.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.860
They fixed you right up, I see.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.000
Vesper's so thoughtful.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:48.210
If I'd been damaged that badly, they would have just thrown me away.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.510
Unfortunately, I could only repair your exterior.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:55.730
At our technological level...

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.100
With Terran technology, your interior is just...

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:02.470
I'm sorry.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:05.820
Hokaze...

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:08.790
Did you know this?

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.700
They say that when an animal is tamed using electricity,

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:18.000
...it's incapable of ever fighting back again.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.980
I got carried away. Ow...

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.650
Come on now, this isn't good.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:09.570
You're with Management, right?

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:14.160
It's good that there were no fatalities because no one was home,

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:18.000
...but how am I supposed to hide a mess like this from the media?

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:26.980
Well, I'll do it. That's my job, after all.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:31.540
But I'd really appreciate it if you'd refrain from activities like this in broad daylight.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.080
My apologies.

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:39.430
So, have you located Vesper's headquarters?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.660
That's part of my job, too.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.520
Oh, that reminds me.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:53.590
The President of the United States was assassinated a while ago.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.410
I'm sorry I'm late, Leader.

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:26.530
No, you're practically early.

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.790
I'm going to borrow Slash for a while.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:31.590
Yes, sir.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.010
I wasn't sure if I should ask you here or not.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:43.430
As Vesper Leader and as a servant of both humanity and Saint,

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.330
...I'm not sure if I should ask you to do this.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.760
Leader?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.190
Take Suguru and run! Right now!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.340
Don't go back to the house! Just go!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:13.370
I lost my daughter, Yuka, and let Ryo die.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.520
No, I let so many of my people die.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.450
And even you, Mahoro.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.210
I send out everyone to a valiant death,

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:26.140
...and yet I alone have stayed hidden, have survived, and kept working,

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:31.440
...telling myself that the future of 10 billion people is at stake.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.100
I've endured all that.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.270
I don't believe that was the wrong choice.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:43.150
But Suguru, he's...

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:50.720
Suguru is my only... Suguru is all I have left!

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:59.360
I understand. I won't let Suguru die, no matter what.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.180
Forgive me.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.470
I'm all too aware that I don't have the right...

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.500
...to ask you to do such a thing now that you've retired.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:14.670
No, Leader. You're mistaken.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:20.420
I, V1046R-MAHORO, will be a Vesper until the day I die.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.920
You... You truly are...

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:48.370
In that this assassination was carried out with so many people watching,

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:52.160
...it is reminiscent of the 1964 Kennedy assassination.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:16:04.480
<b>Special Report! U.S. President Assassinated</b>

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.080
Yes, that's certainly true.

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:57.070
However, some information suggests that a secret organization...

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:59.430
...was involved behind the scenes in this incident.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.860
I'm sure that the investigation now underway will uncover the truth.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:08.850
All right, kiddies! Television time is over!

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:13.880
Even if somebody somewhere gets killed, I have to make a living.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.990
Time for afternoon lessons!

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.210
This just came in.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:28.900
Moments ago, we just received the results of a house search of the command HQ...

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.540
...of the secret society known as Vesper located in Ebisu, Tokyo,

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.830
...conducted by the Metro Police's Public Security Department.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:36.480
The report states that Vesper was deeply involved...

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.790
...in the assassination of the President of the United States.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.140
It appears that many arrests are being made.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.680
Vesper...?

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.580
If Vesper's been... That means Mahoro is...

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.100
Where's Mr. Ryuga?

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:53.600
Mr. Ryuga?

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.170
He's taking the day off because of a cold.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.950
You'd better get back to your classroom, too.

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:06.950
Something happening again...

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.830
Something that I don't understand.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:13.810
Something that's been kept hidden from me.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:21.960
Mahoro!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.660
Hey, it's Mahoro!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:26.380
Hey, you're right, it IS Mahoro!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.880
Hey, Mahoro!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.040
She can't possibly hear you.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.700
But she's waving to us.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:35.920
Hey!

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:37.390
I wonder what's going on?

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.800
Hey!

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.320
Hey! Hey!

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:45.300
Mahoro?

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:49.750
Suguru!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.750
Suguru! Where do you think you're going?!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:02.800
I don't know. But I think it'll probably be someplace far away.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.580
Hey, you're just gonna leave us behind?

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.900
Take us with you! We're best friends, aren't we?!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.260
I can't! I can't get you guys involved!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.860
Not even I have any idea what's happening now.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:18.320
I don't know anything...

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:24.250
But this... this is something I have to do.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:28.200
And it'll probably be really dangerous.

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:33.870
I have to get as far away from here as possible.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.630
Suguru!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:47.230
I came to pick you up!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:47.990
Right.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.500
Thank you.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:05.030
You're true of heart, pure of heart, and gentle of heart.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.380
You truly are Saint's soul.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.370
Me? Saint's soul?

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:33.350
The Terrans have finally succeeded in spatial jumping a massive object.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:40.040
The report says that the ship was carrying machinery and was completely deserted.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:44.670
That was the Terrans' final test.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.830
Next time, they will certainly send an armed warship.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:52.150
It is their speciality of war that has allowed them...

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:57.230
...to so rapidly develop advanced spatial manipulation technology to this extent.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.660
This was not part of Matthew's plan.

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:01.980
Matthew's plan?

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:07.600
The Terrans' activities are beyond Matthew's perfect imagination?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.720
That remains to be seen.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.840
Come along, Minawa. Let's go.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:19.550
Um... What about my big sister?

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:23.540
My body can wait, so please extend her life span first.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.020
Please!

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:29.430
She will be fine.

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:34.800
Don't worry, just focus on getting well soon.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.160
Don't worry.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:46.310
Vesper's satellites are still tracking Mahoro's brooch.

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:50.340
Looks like their elaborate support structure was all for nothing.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:55.930
What's baffling is the fact that another satellite is fixed on another target.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:00.880
Konoe Heavy Industries' Tokyo corporate headquarters...

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.940
Yuichiro, what are you doing?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.710
Let us finally mend this bad blood between us.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:30.510
<b>Mahoro stops functioning in...</b>

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:27.070
Oh, I know. We'll need some fine champagne for that.

