00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:07.570
satellite poem

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:10.180
<b>I see a smiling face before me.</b>

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>A chuckle as we speak.</b>

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:16.010
<b>It seems the same as before, but a fresh wind is blowing.</b>

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:20.360
<b>The person who gently accepts me. The person who gives me warm days.</b>

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:24.880
<b>I'll say it without embarrassment. I'll call you my special someone.</b>

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:27.020
<b>I see a smiling face before me.</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:29.390
<b>A place engulfed by a gentle breeze.</b>

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.910
<b>I want you to stay with me forever, along with carefree days.</b>

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:35.840
<b>Like this forever.</b>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:38.020
<b>Together forever.</b>

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.810
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:45.030
Vesper...

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.970
It means "A single sting of a wasp pitted against a giant elephant".

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.520
But even for a high-spirited wasp like that,

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.300
...if his fellow wasps and even his stinger were taken away from him,

00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:56.820
...all that would be left would be Slash and himself.

00:23:58.030 --> 00:24:00.640
He's like a robot copy of myself,

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.790
...so I guess the two of us together make a whole man.

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:08.580
Suguru my boy, when it's all said and done, everyone stands alone.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:10.800
